# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command profile
usage 1   profile on                    start charging instructions to the innermost routine
usage 2   profile off                   stop (collected counts stay readable)
usage 3   profile clear                 zero the counts, stay armed
usage 4   profile top [<n>]             hottest routines, default 20
usage 5   profile <cpu> on|off|top ...  same, on another processor - `cpus` lists them

case routines
target fake
covers 1-5
$ profile
out 35
Usage: profile on|off|clear|top ...
status 0
action none
$ profile top
out 39
Not profiling - run `profile on` first.
status 0
action none
$ profile on
out 35
Profiling instructions per routine.
status 0
action none
$ profile top
out 21
Nothing profiled yet.
status 0
action none
$ profile top 4
out 21
Nothing profiled yet.
status 0
action none
$ profile off
out 41
Profiling stopped after 0 instruction(s).
status 0
action none
$ profile clear
out 16
Profile cleared.
status 0
action none
$ profile gsu on
out 76
gsu does not report a call stack, so it cannot be profiled - see `man cpus`.
status 1
action none
$ profile cop top
out 76
gsu does not report a call stack, so it cannot be profiled - see `man cpus`.
status 1
action none
$ profile cpu on
out 35
Profiling instructions per routine.
status 0
action none
$ profile frob
out 58
Unknown 'profile' subcommand 'frob'. Try on/off/clear/top.
status 0
action none
end

case a bare target
target bare
covers 1,5
$ profile on
out 65
This core does not report a call stack, so it cannot be profiled.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ profile gsu on
out 65
This core does not report a call stack, so it cannot be profiled.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ profile cop on
out 45
This cartridge has no coprocessor to profile.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ profile on
out 58
No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case on venus
target venus
covers 1,4
$ profile on
out 35
Profiling instructions per routine.
status 0
action none
$ profile top
out 21
Nothing profiled yet.
status 0
action none
end

